  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-08-06T07:34:02.776Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "LightProbeProxyVolume is not available to Udon, and it would be helpful to control when LPPVs are updated to handle room-level active lighting for avatars.  While we can use \"Scripted\" updates and it only updates once at start to conserve CPU, for worlds with a lot of lighting to handle lighting of fluffs, and other large-scale effects, LPPVs are needed.",
